  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電子電路學",
    "sub_ename": "ELECTRONIC CIRCUITS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程中包含兩大部分: 第一部份承襲電子學(1/2/3)更進一步地從系統應用之觀點,針對下列兩大類比電路與IC主題:1.類比式主動濾波器,2.弦式振盪器. 做各型結構之特性與特色分析,評估,並對其缺點提出如何作相關改進的導引. 第二部份則精簡且精確的介紹現今數位IC的家族結構並對其特性做分析與特性改進的評估",
    "describe_eh": "This course contains two part . The first part, extending the discussion of basic analog electronic circuit  to the two system or application oriented topics : (1)analog filters (2) sinusoidal osillators . In this part we are devoted to the study of their properties and guide the student how to resolve them and promte their structure even more .  The second part constitude digital circuits. They present  concise , modern treatment of digital IC and should serve as the basis for a more detailed study of advanced technology digital IC and VLSI design \n",
